/ActualText (A complex diagram illustrating a federated data processing system with multiple nodes \(smartphones, desktops, laptops\) generating secure private data \(D_k\) and representative data \(bar{D_k}\). Arrows indicate the flow of data to a central server labeled \(C\) for model fitting \(\(beta\)\), showcasing data aggregation from distributed sources for analysis. Icons and notations highlight data types and processing steps.)
/A 256 0 R
/K 0
/P 7 0 R
/S /Figure
/T ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/Alt (A complex diagram illustrating a federated data processing system with multiple nodes \(smartphones, desktops, laptops\) generating secure private data \(D_k\) and representative data \(bar{D_k}\). Arrows indicate the flow of data to a central server labeled \(C\) for model fitting \(\(beta\)\), showcasing data aggregation from distributed sources for analysis. Icons and notations highlight data types and processing steps.)
>>
